[Email]
EmailFloodedBody=There is a problem with the main bilge. I think I have managed a work-around. If any of the compartments flood again, try activating the secondary pump in the forecastle.
EmailFloodedDate=June 28th, 2007
EmailFloodedFrom=Gerardo
EmailFloodedSubject=Flooding
EmailFloodedTo=Ignacio

EmailLacerdaBody=I’ll arrive aboard your ship sometime tonight. Please keep your smelly hooligans out of my way. I don’t want to be disturbed.
EmailLacerdaDate=June 28th, 2007
EmailLacerdaFrom=Hugo Lacerda 
EmailLacerdaSubject=Coming Aboard
EmailLacerdaTo=Captain Diego

EmailInfoBody=The body of American Bruce Morgenholt was recovered in Peru today. No cause of death has been announced, but the US State Department has demanded an apology from the Peruvian Army for their possible role in a botched rescue operation.
EmailInfoDate=June 28th, 2007
EmailInfoFrom=WNM News Wire
EmailInfoSubject=Morgenholt Found Dead in Peru
EmailInfoTo=Subscriber

EmailInfo2Body=Japan’s I-SDF revealed their findings into the events surrounding ‘Black Gold Day’. The report alleges that North Korean and Chinese information warfare attacks may have manipulated worldwide markets to bring about the economic collapse in Japan.
EmailInfo2Date=June 28th, 2007
EmailInfo2From=WNM News Wire
EmailInfo2Subject=I-SDF Alleges North Korean Involvement in Market Crash
EmailInfo2To=Subscriber

EmailEngineRoomBody=I’m very worried about the sealant rings on the gas pipes. We already have several small gas leaks. If it gets worse, a single spark could sink this rat trap.
EmailEngineRoomDate=June 28th, 2007
EmailEngineRoomFrom=Pedro 
EmailEngineRoomSubject=Engine Room
EmailEngineRoomTo=Cornelio
